---
const content = {
  es: {
    htmlLang: "es",
    pageTitle: "Presentación",
    role: "Desarrollador de Software Jr",
    bio: `
Soy Christian Ballesteros Pérez, desarrollador en formación con base técnica en informática, telecomunicaciones y desarrollo de aplicaciones. Actualmente curso el FP de Grado Superior en Desarrollo de Aplicaciones Multiplataforma, donde refuerzo mis conocimientos en programación, lógica de aplicaciones y entornos de desarrollo.

Cuento con experiencia profesional en el sector de telecomunicaciones, participando en el diseño FTTH y la elaboración de planos técnicos detallados para proveedores, así como experiencia previa en soporte informático, ofreciendo asistencia técnica a usuarios en la configuración de VPN, gestión de incidencias de correo corporativo y recuperación de credenciales.

A nivel técnico, he desarrollado una demo funcional de un videojuego 2D, trabajando con editores de mapas, sistemas de eventos y lógica de juego, lo que me ha permitido afianzar conceptos de diseño, estructuración de estados y comportamiento dentro de una aplicación interactiva.
Actualmente, me encuentro desarrollando una aplicación que integra tecnologías de reconocimiento de texto (OCR), enfocada en la extracción y procesamiento de información relevante para el usuario.

Actualmente, amplío mis competencias en Power BI, enfocado en modelado de datos, desarrollo de medidas DAX y visualización de KPIs.
Además, he participado en la automatización de procesos en entornos SOAR, desarrollando soluciones en Python e integraciones con APIs para el tratamiento de alertas, filtrado de eventos y orquestación de acciones automatizadas sobre sistemas.

Me considero una persona responsable, trabajadora y orientada al aprendizaje continuo, con buena capacidad de trabajo en equipo y adaptación a nuevos retos tecnológicos.
`,
    tags: ["Backend", "Python", "Power BI", "Docker", "Ciberseguridad"],
    links: [
      { label: "Ver CV", href: "/CartaPresentacion/CV-Christian-Ballesteros.pdf" },
      { label: "LinkedIn", href: "https://www.linkedin.com/in/c-ballesteros/" },
      { label: "GitHub", href: "https://github.com/Christian-B-P" },
    ],
  },
  en: {
    htmlLang: "en",
    pageTitle: "Presentation",
    role: "Junior Software Developer",
    bio: `
I am Christian Ballesteros Pérez, a developer in training with a technical background in IT, telecommunications, and application development. I am currently studying a Higher Vocational Diploma in Multiplatform Application Development, where I continue to strengthen my knowledge of programming, application logic, and development environments.

I have professional experience in the telecommunications sector, contributing to FTTH design and the preparation of detailed technical plans for providers, as well as previous experience in IT support, assisting users with VPN configuration, corporate email issue management, and credential recovery.

From a technical perspective, I have developed a functional demo of a 2D video game, working with map editors, event systems, and game logic, which has helped me strengthen concepts related to design, state structuring, and behavior within an interactive application.
I am currently developing an application that integrates optical character recognition (OCR) technologies, focused on extracting and processing relevant information for the user.

I am currently expanding my skills in Power BI, focusing on data modeling, DAX measure development, and KPI visualization.
In addition, I have participated in process automation within SOAR environments, developing Python-based solutions and API integrations for alert handling, event filtering, and the orchestration of automated actions across systems.

I consider myself a responsible, hard-working person with a strong commitment to continuous learning, good teamwork skills, and the ability to adapt to new technological challenges.
`,
    tags: ["Backend", "Python", "Power BI", "Docker", "Cybersecurity"],
    links: [
      { label: "View CV", href: "/CartaPresentacion/CV-Christian-Ballesteros.pdf" },
      { label: "LinkedIn", href: "https://www.linkedin.com/in/c-ballesteros/" },
      { label: "GitHub", href: "https://github.com/Christian-B-P" },
    ],
  },
};

const name = "Christian Ballesteros Pérez";
const defaultLang = "es";
const t = content[defaultLang];
---

<html lang={t.htmlLang}>
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>{name} — {t.pageTitle}</title>
    <meta name="description" content={`${name} — ${t.role}.`} />

    <style>
      :root { color-scheme: dark; }

      body {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, Arial;
        background: radial-gradient(1200px 700px at 20% 10%, rgba(99,102,241,.25), transparent 60%),
                    radial-gradient(900px 500px at 85% 25%, rgba(34,197,94,.18), transparent 55%),
                    #070b14;
        color: rgba(255,255,255,.92);
        overflow-x: hidden;
      }

      .wrap {
        max-width: 980px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 56px 18px;
      }

      .card {
        position: relative;
        border-radius: 22px;
        padding: 28px;
        background: rgba(255,255,255,.06);
        border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);
        backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
        box-shadow: 0 20px 80px rgba(0,0,0,.45);
        transform: translateY(14px);
        opacity: 0;
        animation: rise .8s ease forwards;
        text-align: center;
      }

      .glow {
        position: absolute;
        inset: -1px;
        border-radius: 22px;
        background: radial-gradient(500px 200px at 30% 10%, rgba(99,102,241,.25), transparent 60%),
                    radial-gradient(400px 200px at 80% 30%, rgba(34,197,94,.18), transparent 55%);
        filter: blur(10px);
        opacity: .9;
        pointer-events: none;
      }

      .topbar {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: flex-end;
        margin-bottom: 18px;
        position: relative;
        z-index: 2;
      }

      .lang-switch {
        display: inline-flex;
        gap: 8px;
        padding: 6px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        background: rgba(255,255,255,.06);
        border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);
      }

      .lang-btn {
        border: 0;
        background: transparent;
        color: rgba(255,255,255,.78);
        padding: 8px 14px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        cursor: pointer;
        font-size: 14px;
        font-weight: 600;
        transition: background .2s ease, color .2s ease, transform .12s ease;
      }

      .lang-btn:hover {
        transform: translateY(-1px);
        color: rgba(255,255,255,.95);
      }

      .lang-btn.active {
        background: rgba(255,255,255,.14);
        color: rgba(255,255,255,.98);
      }

      h1 {
        margin: 0 0 6px;
        font-size: clamp(34px, 4vw, 46px);
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
        position: relative;
        z-index: 2;
      }

      .role {
        margin: 0 0 16px;
        color: rgba(255,255,255,.78);
        font-size: 16px;
        position: relative;
        z-index: 2;
      }

      .bio {
        margin: 0 0 18px;
        line-height: 1.65;
        color: rgba(255,255,255,.82);
        max-width: 70ch;
        white-space: pre-line;
        margin-left: auto;
        margin-right: auto;
        position: relative;
        z-index: 2;
      }

      .tags {
        display: flex;
        gap: 10px;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        margin: 10px 0 18px;
        justify-content: center;
        position: relative;
        z-index: 2;
      }

      .tag {
        border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14);
        background: rgba(255,255,255,.06);
        padding: 6px 10px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        font-size: 13px;
        color: rgba(255,255,255,.8);
      }

      .row {
        display: flex;
        gap: 12px;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        margin-top: 8px;
        justify-content: center;
        position: relative;
        z-index: 2;
      }

      a.btn {
        text-decoration: none;
        color: rgba(255,255,255,.96);
        padding: 13px 18px;
        border-radius: 16px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.22);
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(99,102,241,.34), rgba(34,197,94,.24));
        box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.22), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.08);
        transition: transform .12s ease, background .2s ease, border-color .2s ease, box-shadow .2s ease;
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 10px;
        will-change: transform;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: .01em;
      }

      a.btn::after {
        content: "->";
        font-size: 14px;
        opacity: .82;
        transition: transform .2s ease, opacity .2s ease;
      }

      a.btn:hover {
        transform: translateY(-3px);
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(99,102,241,.48), rgba(34,197,94,.34));
        border-color: rgba(255,255,255,.32);
        box-shadow: 0 18px 34px rgba(0,0,0,.3), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.12);
      }

      a.btn:hover::after {
        transform: translateX(3px);
        opacity: 1;
      }

      a.btn:focus-visible {
        outline: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,.9);
        outline-offset: 3px;
      }

      @keyframes rise {
        to { transform: translateY(0); opacity: 1; }
      }

      @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
        .card { animation: none; opacity: 1; transform: none; }
        a.btn, .lang-btn { transition: none; }
      }
    </style>
  </head>

  <body>
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="glow"></div>

        <div class="topbar">
          <div class="lang-switch">
            <button id="btn-es" class="lang-btn active" type="button">ES</button>
            <button id="btn-en" class="lang-btn" type="button">EN</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <h1 id="name">{name}</h1>
        <p id="role" class="role">{t.role}</p>
        <p id="bio" class="bio">{t.bio}</p>

        <div id="tags" class="tags">
          {t.tags.map((tag) => (
            <span class="tag">{tag}</span>
          ))}
        </div>

        <div id="links" class="row">
          {t.links.map((l) => (
            <a class="btn" href={l.href} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
              {l.label}
            </a>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <script define:vars={{ content, name }}>
      const btnEs = document.getElementById("btn-es");
      const btnEn = document.getElementById("btn-en");
      const roleEl = document.getElementById("role");
      const bioEl = document.getElementById("bio");
      const tagsEl = document.getElementById("tags");
      const linksEl = document.getElementById("links");

      function renderLanguage(lang) {
        const t = content[lang] || content.es;

        document.documentElement.lang = t.htmlLang;
        document.title = `${name} — ${t.pageTitle}`;

        const metaDescription = document.querySelector('meta[name="description"]');
        if (metaDescription) {
          metaDescription.setAttribute("content", `${name} — ${t.role}.`);
        }

        roleEl.textContent = t.role;
        bioEl.textContent = t.bio;

        tagsEl.innerHTML = t.tags
          .map((tag) => `<span class="tag">${tag}</span>`)
          .join("");

        linksEl.innerHTML = t.links
          .map(
            (link) => `
              <a class="btn" href="${link.href}" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
                ${link.label}
              </a>
            `
          )
          .join("");

        btnEs.classList.toggle("active", lang === "es");
        btnEn.classList.toggle("active", lang === "en");

        localStorage.setItem("language", lang);
      }

      const savedLang = localStorage.getItem("language") || "es";
      renderLanguage(savedLang);

      btnEs.addEventListener("click", () => renderLanguage("es"));
      btnEn.addEventListener("click", () => renderLanguage("en"));
    </script>
  </body>
</html>
